2026-11-12T01:26:02.6070710Z 
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6071430Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6071880Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6072620Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6073110Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6073460Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6073750Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6074230Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6074620Z    /var/root
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6095620Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6096370Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6128620Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6129820Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6130240Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6130770Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-11-12T01:26:02.6131140Z 
